],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-01-16T15:58:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T22:06:34Z","closed_at":"2025-03-16T00:45:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101641","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101641.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101641.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-16T00:45:43Z"},"body":"This PR aims to fix a long-standing problem annoyance with the SCons buildsystem: storing build objects in the same directory as the source code. While there *is* a built-in functionality that somewhat addresses this issue via `VariantDir`[^1], it's not a suitable out-of-the-box solution with the way our repo is setup, and it doesn't easily account for the files we **want** in the source code (eg: generated scripts). Instead, there's another built-in way of achieving this goal that *does* work for us: **custom emitters**[^2]! With these, we can directly modify the target/source lists of a given builder, allowing us to seamlessly reroute our intermediate build files.\r\n\r\nThis implementation adds the option `redirect_build_objects` to the buildsystem, enabled by default. When on, all built objects/libraries are redirected to the root `bin/obj/` folder automatically, preserving the passed subfolder structure. This will not apply to any builder calls passing `redirect_build_objects=False` (see `platform/android/SCsub`). The emitter has been applied to `StaticObject`, `SharedObject`, `StaticLibrary`, `SharedLibrary`, and `RES` — it **doesn't** apply to any of the other builders (e.g. generated scripts, `Program`), as we want to keep their output as-is.\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://scons.org/doc/production/HTML/scons-user/ch15s04.html\r\n[^2]: https://scons.org/doc/production/HTML/scons-user/ch17s06.html","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com